# comment-full-line

## Input

```
# This is a full-line comment
key value

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..40
  COMMENT@0..29 "# This is a full-line ..."
  NEWLINE@29..30 "\n"
  ENTRY@30..40
    WORD_KEY@30..33
      WORD@30..33 "key"
    SPACE@33..34 " "
    LINE_STRING@34..39
      STRING@34..39 "value"
    NEWLINE@39..40 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@30..33 "key",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@34..39 "value",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

